          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Q.8. Mudhol Hounds (a type of breed of Indian dogs) are largely found in North Karnataka’s Bagalkote and Vijaypura districts. The government took an initiative to protect this breed by providing support to those who adopted these dogs. Due to this initiative, the number of these dogs increased. The number of Mudhol dogs in",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": " six villages of Karnataka are as follows"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 3,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.255,
            0.872,
            0.274
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Village A : 18, Village B : 36, Village C : 12, Village D : 48, Village E : 18, Village F : 24",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "text",
          "index": 4,
          "bbox": [
            0.116,
            0.287,
            0.622,
            0.306
          ],
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "text",
              "content": "Prepare a pictograph and answer the following questions:",
              "styles": [
                "bold"
